   "priceMinor": 18200,
   "currency": "USD",
   "availability": "in_stock",
   "description": "Along the wild Lost Coast of California, a rough stretch of sand runs for over 3 miles between the foaming ocean and wild countryside. The place is known as Black Sands Beach - the only beach with black sand in continental USA and with its wild beauty the inspiration for the WestCoastDiver (WCD). With a grainy texturised dial resembling black sand, this new series captures the colours of this rough, untouched coastline. With its robust stainless steel case and clear california dial design, the WCD is perfectly suited to explore the Lost Coast. Inside an automatic Japanese movement purely powered by kinetic energy is driving polished rock grey hands filled to the brim with lume for low light situations. The WCD is delivered on a waxxed Italian leather strap with a second fully water resistant FKM strap.",
